y we can rest  assured that things will get worse  before they get better  and the better things are going right  now the more the situation will look bad  later on  there's a sort of buzzed feeling right  now for the good guys things seem to be  going  their way and they're excited as if  nothing can go wrong and if we've seen  enough shonen we know that that's when  we gotta be on our guard the most  so as we proceed yes let's enjoy the  epicness but also be prepared for some  sort of devastating setback or loss  in the near future we start this chapter  with big mom on the ground  taken down by frankie an absolutely epic  moment  showing no fear and absolute disrespect  to a yonko if that  ain't the crew member of the future  pirate king i don't know who is  people are hilariously shocked that  someone actually ran over big mob  and i absolutely love when characters  are fearless around the character who  would otherwise have people walking on  eggshells around them think of how luffy  punched the celestial dragon  when no one else would frankie had the  same energy at the end of the last  chapter as jinbei says they're in for a  treat and asks robin for help and nami  hugs frankie in gratitude luffy  acknowledges what frankie did  he's not surprised but just smiles  saying great work frankie as  expected and this is something i'm  noticing more and more in luffy  as a leader he's placing a lot of faith  in his crew and he has to do that that's  nowhere more clear than in situations  like this  where there are many powerful opponents  in addition to the main boss  and one man can't be expected to take on  the strongest creature in the world  plus other s-tier fighters at the same  time i really like that about one piece  much like in real life it continues to  foreground the importance of teamwork  even so  far into the story instead of just  having luffy become  strong enough to beat everyone so his  teammates become irrelevant in battle  and then we get the waited for moment  momonosuke reacting to yamato saying  she's his father  odin luffy lets them know that yamato is  on their side but they don't look too  convinced as  yamato runs towards them saying she's  odin and she will protect them  shinobi and momonosuke look back like  they're seeing the bad guy in a horror  film they continue to run while luffy  goes chasing after kinemon wanting to  face off against kaido  i can totally picture yamato screaming  after momonosuke come back and let your  father  love you such a bizarre and funny  situation will no doubt continue as we  move forward  big mom gets up looking evil and mad  cursing the straw hats  now they're gonna get it you may think  you can only mess with ayanko for so  long you may think  everyone else does and starts running  from big mom screaming for their lives  while hyogoro decides to find a toby  ropo  since these wasted extras just feel like  a waste of time for him  but no the straw hats are unfazed brook  waves hello to the yonko and frankie  asks how the old hag  likes his iron body before introducing  himself probably one of the most epic  introductions big mom has ever  experienced  nami speaks rationally warning frankie  to run away since she's a yonko  but there isn't much room for  rationality in the crew of the future  pirate king  frankie simply smiles brushing off the  idea by saying  and i quote aren't we gonna make our  captain the pirate king  end quote a goosebump inducing moment  and you can  already see how we're witnessing history  in the making and the legend of the  pirate king's crew members  is already in motion people will be  talking 100 years from now about how  frankie the pirate king  shipwright stood up to a yonko and even  talked down to her in this famous war  a living legend that's what frankie is  but as he's about to launch an attack  the numbers come in towering over people  frankie notices that they are the same  race as  oars and big mom is excited to see the  so-called failed ancient giants  from punk hazard and that seems to be a  recurring theme in kaido's crew the  revival of the ancient world  with its deadliest creature looked  another way though  you could also say that this symbolizes  how kaido is a fossil  and his time is over and he'll need to  make room for the new era  but anyways one number is straight up  holding usoff's team  and so frankie launches his radical beam  at him instead  despite the huge size of the numbers the  beam does send him flying back releasing  our  guys and all of a sudden people who were  saying oh it's a yonko  are now saying oh it's a laser beam  pretty epic how our straw hat crew can  shine even next to a yonko  as big mom's about to hit frankie jinbei  comes to the rescue  using fishman karate he flips the yonko  while robin uses her ability to make the  round  airborne yonko roll away not only are  the straw hats willing to upset the  yonko once they just  keep messing with her more and more and  in this arc more than any other  we are seeing that yonkos are not as  scary or untouchable  as they seem to be before imagine how  much  luffy's reputation will grow after the  world hears that his crew members were  playing around with big mom running her  over with motorcycles  and even passing her around like a beach  ball yes they're not stronger than big  mom  but that doesn't really matter here  they're brave enough to significantly  disrespect her  and invoke her anger which raises their  reputation in the world's eye while  diminishing big mom's  own as a sweating upset and spinning big  mom  threatens jinbe's life he simply says do  your worst  on a rhetorical and vibe level at least  some straw hats are already yonko level  being able to talk back to big mom  without blinking and that is a huge deal  illustrating that there is much more to  a story than who would win in a death  battle nico robin and jinbe smile  about what they did to big mom while  acknowledging that she will come back  angrier than ever i gotta admit that i  love the dynamic between these two  the bystanders who have become a pretty  huge joke by this point start shouting  that it's jinbei the former warlord  and first son of the sea literally  instead of fighting these guys are just  shocked by one thing after another  and you start to finally get why luffy  is so picky with his crew  and why he only has a few crew members  relatively speaking  what's the point of having guys like  this who are useless in a fight  all they would do is annoy you and cost  the crew extra money to feed  as frankie checks in on chopper and  usopp we get a pretty hilarious moment  as they get excited about fusing before  we jump to queen and his striking  moustache  queen is just enjoying a smoke in the  middle of the battle  when he sees luffy passing by zoro is  there too  while queen just keeps looking on  shocked zoro just agrees to tag along  with luffy who's going to fight kaido  and i can't help but love that this is  definitely one of the best bromances in  anime  and i always enjoy seeing these two  interact as luffy is going to take them  both  up queen turns into a dinosaur and  catches luffy in his mouth king is  present too with his flying fam  zorro says they're not going anywhere  with them around and luffy points out  that even the sky is heavily guarded  which is a nice touch  kaido straight up has land and sky  covered with his crew  quite the formidable force as the cool  fusion is underway to usopps  and chopper's amazement we get to see  sanji and he's pretty fine and  hilariously curses the durability  of his stinking suit it being so good  angers him but at this point everyone's  gotta use  everything they've got and i look  forward to seeing how sanji's gonna  contribute from here  being able to walk away from the attack  of the top all-star is pretty epic  as the number is taken down hyogoro sees  chopper and luffy coming down from the  sky  and enemies all around he still can't  help but smile and remark that it  doesn't feel like they're losing and  again it really doesn't  the vibe is very much positive uplifting  like  we're really doing this kind of  atmosphere we see  all the straw hats together looking epic  in one panel  a moment we gotta appreciate and i gotta  admit sanji probably looks the coolest  here  now in his classy clothes and smoking  together they prepared to help luffy get  to kaido  while sanji remarks about many flying  devil fruit users in the sky  and again luffy affirms that he's gonna  mop the floor with kaido  and that he trusts his crew to handle  the rest we got numbers we got queen and  king  and we got possible toby ropos that need  to be beat or at least distracted for  luffy to get the kaido we can be sure  that the next chapters are going to be  filled with some epic matchups and to me  this collective panel is pretty much  saying the real fight starts now  another epic chapter setting the  groundwork for the epic battles to come  let me know what you thought about this  one and any theories of what you expect  to happen next  if we're gonna get hit with a big loss  as i think we are who do you think might  be the victim  let me know if you did enjoy this review  and want to keep them coming the best  thing you could do is smash  that like button and share this video  with any cultured pirates that you know  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell and select  all or you will miss future one-piece  videos and while you impatiently wait  for the next chapter to drop  check out my growing one piece playlist  where you'll find videos about the yonko  warlords supernovas  all the different devil fruit users and  more link in the description  thanks again and until next time see us  space cowboys  [Music]  you

